    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Click it every time you're done changing your code in order to execute your app. The platform compiles your code and sends the result to the Web View below."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "One habit you should build right now:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Don't write everything first and run once at the end. Run after each small change."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "If something breaks, you'll know exactly which line caused it."
